{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple, yet deceptively difficult journey of balance and contemplation. In JUMP ON THE BALL!, you'll navigate a whimsical dreamscape and face the ultimate challenge: staying on the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a minimalist, dreamlike sandbox where the goal is straightforward, but the execution is anything but. Can you master the ball and conquer all three levels? The challenge makes for a very memey, and streamable experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972480/extras/e4b820a702e03e3d7dc863f0c543743e.poster.avif?t=1759395628\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972480/extras/e4b820a702e03e3d7dc863f0c543743e.webm?t=1759395628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972480/extras/e4b820a702e03e3d7dc863f0c543743e.mp4?t=1759395628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on the ball, and see how long you can stay on. Life is all about finding balance, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Challenging Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Soothing Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and Night maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise Sandbox Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 big mystery</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972480?t=1759395628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images